  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover Rothco's innovative Combat Shirt, crafted for comfort yet designed for protection. Engineered from a no-melt, drip-resistant fabric, it withstands temperatures up to 230 degrees Fahrenheit on the chest and back.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "35257",
  "description": "<p>Discover Rothco's innovative Combat Shirt, crafted for comfort yet designed for protection. Engineered from a no-melt, drip-resistant fabric, it withstands temperatures up to 230 degrees Fahrenheit on the chest and back. The lightweight, breathable material efficiently wicks moisture away, ensuring you stay dry. Nylon cotton rip-stop sleeves enhance durability, complemented by anti-abrasion padded elbow patches and gusseted sleeves for optimal action. The glint tape holder and loop field on sleeve pockets facilitate customization with name, rank, and flag patches. Ideal for military and tactical use, especially under heavy body armor, it features hook &amp; loop adjustable cuffs and a mock turtle neck design for a secure fit.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
